# Verilog Ternary & Blocking Caveat

## Overview
A compact Verilog RTL practice project covering:
- Ternary operator (? :)
- Blocking assignment (=)
- Blocking assignment ordering/caveat
- Basic RTL simulation

## Topics
1. Ternary Operator
2. Blocking Assignment
3. Blocking Caveat
4. Simulation & Verification

## Project Structure

rtl/       → RTL design
tb/        → Testbench
examples/  → Concept demonstration

## Key Learning
- Use ternary operators for simple conditional logic.
- Blocking assignments execute sequentially.
- Assignment order can affect simulation results.

## Tools
- Verilog
- Icarus Verilog / EDA Playground
- GTKWave

## Result
Verified RTL behavior through simulation waveforms.
